    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105904" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυμπᾰν-ιστής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>,
